      "sharedPrompt": "Preserve the user's subject and reference identity. Keep the result readable at sticker size with a clean transparent silhouette. Add lettering only when requested. Combine selected themes coherently without crowding the subject. Presets are creative guidance: retain the approved artwork when building or editing it; do not redesign approved parts to reapply a preset.",
